{"ticker":"ROK","updated":"2026-10-23T23:58:13Z","profile":{"longName":"Rockwell Automation, Inc.","shortName":"Rockwell Automation, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"United States","website":"https://www.rockwellautomation.com","fullTimeEmployees":26000,"marketCap":47414943744,"trailingPE":39.897938,"forwardPE":28.572655,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.2841797,"pegRatio":1.81,"targetMeanPrice":474.88,"targetHighPrice":550.0,"targetLowPrice":282.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":25,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.079,"earningsGrowth":0.404,"grossMargins":0.49091998,"operatingMargins":0.20968,"profitMargins":0.13385001,"totalRevenue":8972999680,"beta":1.501,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":497.36,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":347.53,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.3},"summary":"Rockwell Automation, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides industrial automation and digital transformation solutions in North America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia Pacific, and Latin America. It operates in three segments: Intelligent Devices, Software & Control, and Lifecycle Services. The company offers drives, motion, advanced material handling, safety, sensing, industrial components, hardware, software, and configured-to-order products; and control and visualization software and hardware, digital twin, simulation and information software, network and security infrastructure, and custom-engineered systems. It also provides digital consulting, professional services, engineered-to-order solutions, recurring services, cybersecurity, safety, remote monitoring, customer technical support and repair, asset management and optimization consulting, and training, as well as spare parts. The company sells its products through independent distributors in relation to its direct sales force. It serves discrete end markets, including automotive, semiconductor, e-commerce, and warehouse automation; hybrid end markets, such as food and beverage, life sciences, and tire; and process end markets comprising energy, mining, and chemicals. The company was formerly known as Rockwell International Corporation and changed its name to Rockwell Automation, Inc. in February 2002.","summary_zh":"羅克韋爾自動化公司及其子公司在北美、歐洲、中東、非洲、亞太地區和拉丁美洲提供工業自動化和數位轉型解決方案。它分為三個部分：智慧型設備、軟體和控制以及生命週期服務。該公司提供驅動、運動、先進材料處理、安全、感測、工業組件、硬體、軟體和按訂單配置的產品；控制和視覺化軟體和硬體、數位孿生、類比和資訊軟體、網路和安全基礎設施以及客製化工程系統。它還提供數位諮詢、專業服務、按訂單設計的解決方案、定期服務、網路安全、安全、遠端監控、客戶技術支援和維修、資產管理和優化諮詢以及培訓以及備件。該公司透過與其直銷隊伍相關的獨立分銷商銷售其產品。它服務於離散終端市場，包括汽車、半導體、電子商務和倉庫自動化；混合終端市場，例如食品和飲料、生命科學和輪胎；以及加工終端市場，包括能源、採礦和化學品。公司前身為羅克韋爾國際公司，2002 年 2 月更名為羅克韋爾自動化公司。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"特種工業機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":350.75,"h":351.88,"l":349.45,"c":349.97,"v":465300},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":349.48,"h":357.36,"l":348.41,"c":355.67,"v":1498100},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":353.65,"h":356.15,"l":347.88,"c":349.2,"v":1222000},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":351.61,"h":351.94,"l":348.44,"c":349.13,"v":920800},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":348.44,"h":349.75,"l":342.01,"c":343.43,"v":697300},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":338.71,"h":340.65,"l":334.3,"c":337.84,"v":1076700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":338.07,"h":338.79,"l":335.16,"c":338.66,"v":514100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":339.92,"h":342.15,"l":337.05,"c":341.86,"v":378200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":343.5,"h":345.67,"l":337.39,"c":339.76,"v":539600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":344.77,"h":347.7,"l":340.73,"c":344.67,"v":1195000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":344.16,"h":344.16,"l":338.22,"c":342.95,"v":540400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":341.92,"h":347.33,"l":336.98,"c":339.39,"v":709700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":340.93,"h":351.51,"l":340.51,"c":350.54,"v":730900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":349.39,"h":349.39,"l":344.9,"c":344.93,"v":545700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":346.2,"h":348.06,"l":343.95,"c":346.44,"v":621300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":346.0,"h":346.31,"l":338.81,"c":342.26,"v":918400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":342.5,"h":348.02,"l":340.21,"c":344.66,"v":892100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":345.92,"h":350.81,