:2},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":2},{"name":"財報","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2025-11-12","period":"2025-09-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1024478/000102447825000116/rok-20250930.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Rockwell Automation, Inc. (Rockwell Automation or the Company) is the world's largest company dedicated to industrial automation and digital transformation. We understand and simplify our customers' complex production challenges and deliver the most valued solutions that combine technology and industry expertise. As a result, we make our customers more resilient, agile, and sustainable, creating more ways to win. See Item 7. Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations (MD&A) for additional information on our business and long-term strategy.","zh":"羅克韋爾自動化公司（羅克韋爾自動化或公司）是全球最大的致力於工業自動化和數位轉型的公司。我們了解並簡化客戶複雜的生產挑戰，並提供結合技術和行業專業知識的最有價值的解決方案。因此，我們使客戶變得更有彈性、敏捷和永續，創造更多的獲勝方式。有關我們業務和長期策略的更多資訊，請參閱第 7 項「管理層對財務狀況和經營業績的討論與分析 (MD&A)」。"},{"en":"The Company continues the business founded as the Allen-Bradley Company in 1903. The privately-owned Allen-Bradley Company was a leading North American manufacturer of industrial automation equipment when the former Rockwell International Corporation (RIC) purchased it in 1985.","zh":"公司繼續經營 1903 年成立的 Allen-Bradley 公司。這家私人的 Allen-Bradley 公司是北美領先的工業自動化設備製造商，前羅克韋爾國際公司 (RIC) 於 1985 年收購了該公司。"},{"en":"The Company was incorporated in Delaware in connection with a tax-free reorganization completed on December 6, 1996, pursuant to which we divested our former aerospace and defense businesses (the A&D Business) to The Boeing Company (Boeing). In the reorganization, RIC contributed all of its businesses, other than the A&D Business, to the Company and distributed all capital stock of the Company to RIC's shareowners. Boeing then acquired RIC.","zh":"該公司於 1996 年 12 月 6 日完成免稅重組後在特拉華州註冊成立，根據該重組，我們將先前的航空航太和國防業務（A&D 業務）剝離給了波音公司 (Boeing)。在重組中，RIC將其除A&D業務之外的所有業務均捐獻給公司，並將公司的全部股本分配給RIC的股東。隨後波音公司收購了 RIC。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Intelligent Devices","val":3756000000,"zh":"智慧型設備部門"},{"name":"Software & Control","val":2383000000,"zh":"軟體與控制部門"},{"name":"Lifecycle Services","val":2203000000,"zh":"生命週期服務部門"}],"total":8342000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Productsand Solutions","val":7364000000,"zh":"產品與解決方案"},{"name":"Service","val":978000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":8342000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"North America","val":5270000000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"US","val":4847000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":1488000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":1024000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Latin America","val":560000000,"zh":"拉丁美洲"}],"total":8342000000}},"peers":["PH","ETN","ROP","TER","ITW"]}}